<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;Because [doc://perlrun#-E-commandline|-E] implicitly enables all optional features and builtins, which [doc://feature#FEATURE-BUNDLES|as of 5.40 includes] [doc://feature#The-'try'-feature], and AFAICT [doc://perlsyn#Try-Catch-Exception-Handling|that &lt;c&gt;try&lt;/c&gt;] requires a &lt;c&gt;catch&lt;/c&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
